## Key Concepts
- **CKNE-to-resource mapping**: Weighted allocation formulas ensuring proportional resource distribution
- **Rebalancing mechanics**: Minute-level redistribution with weighted fair queueing and preemption budgets
- **SLA preservation**: Baseline guarantees through fallback mechanisms and priority queuing
- **Essential telemetry**: Per-tenant latency metrics, resource utilization patterns, and tail latency analysis

## Code Example
```javascript
function calculateQuotas(ckne, baseConcurrency, baseMemory, baseBudget) {
  const weight = 0.4 + 0.6 * ckne; // Primary resource weight
  const coldWeight = 0.3 + 0.7 * ckne; // Cold-start budget weight

  return {
    concurrency: Math.round(baseConcurrency * weight),
    memory: Math.round(baseMemory * weight),
    coldStartBudget: Math.round(baseBudget * coldWeight)
  };
}

// Rebalancing logic
function rebalanceInvocations(pendingInvocations) {
  const lowCKNE = pendingInvocations.filter(i => i.ckne < 0.5);
  const highCKNE = pendingInvocations.filter(i => i.ckne > 0.7);

  return redistributeWithFairness(lowCKNE, highCKNE);
}
```

